# The site key of DashGen's Cloudflare Turnstile widget, which Vite builds into
# the page (ADR-0021). Leave it unset locally: the page then uses Cloudflare's
# test key, which passes everyone. CI sets it for the deployed page, from the
# repo variable TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY (docs/runbooks/deploy.md#the-turnstile-widget).
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=your_site_key_here
